---
import CutToContextLayout from '../../layouts/CutToContextLayout.astro';
import { cuttocontext } from '../../config/cuttocontext';

const mailto = `mailto:${cuttocontext.email}`;
---

<CutToContextLayout
  title="Privacy Policy - CutToContext"
  description="How the CutToContext upload tool accesses, stores and deletes data."
  heading="Privacy Policy"
>
  <h2 id="who-runs-it">Who runs it</h2>
  <p>CutToContext is a personal project run by Rohit Garg. Questions about this policy go to <a href={mailto}>{cuttocontext.email}</a>.</p>

  <h2 id="what-the-tool-accesses">What the tool accesses</h2>
  <p>The CutToContext upload tool only connects to accounts owned by its operator. It accesses:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Google / YouTube:</strong> uploads videos to the operator's own channel, sets their titles, descriptions and other metadata, reads YouTube Analytics for that channel, and reads comments on its own videos.</li>
    <li><strong>Instagram / Meta:</strong> publishes Reels to the operator's own account and reads insights and comments for that account.</li>
    <li><strong>X:</strong> publishes posts to the operator's own account and reads metrics for that account.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="what-is-stored">What is stored</h2>
  <p>The tool stores OAuth access tokens on the operator's own machine or server, along with video metadata, performance metrics and comment text for the operator's own content. No data from other people's accounts is collected.</p>
  <p>This website uses GoatCounter, a cookieless page-view counter, like the rest of rohitgarrg.com.</p>

  <h2 id="sharing">Sharing</h2>
  <p>Data is not sold, not shared with third parties, and not used for advertising or to train AI models.</p>

  <h2 id="google-limited-use">Google API Services</h2>
  <p>CutToContext's use and transfer to any other app of information received from Google APIs will adhere to the <a href="https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy">Google API Services User Data Policy</a>, including the Limited Use requirements.</p>

  <h2 id="youtube">YouTube API Services</h2>
  <p>CutToContext uses YouTube API Services. By using it, you agree to be bound by the <a href="https://www.youtube.com/t/terms">YouTube Terms of Service</a>. See the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Google Privacy Policy</a> for how Google handles data.</p>

  <h2 id="revoking-access">Revoking access</h2>
  <p>Google access can be revoked at any time at <a href="https://myaccount.google.com/permissions">myaccount.google.com/permissions</a>. Meta and X access can be revoked from the connected apps section of each platform's settings.</p>

  <h2 id="data-deletion">Data deletion</h2>
  <p>To request deletion of any data held by CutToContext, email <a href={mailto}>{cuttocontext.email}</a>. Deletion is completed within 30 days.</p>

  <p class="caption">Last updated {cuttocontext.lastUpdated}</p>
</CutToContextLayout>
